  "description": "Yu Yu was bullied during his school days for his obesity, but after years of hard work and exercise, he has become a famous beauty director sought by everyone. However, his issues with talking to women pose a problem when dealing with customers. Thus his boss assigns him and several other troublemakers a project in order to fix their problems. During this event, his old crush, Ain Joo, appears in front of him.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://page.kakao.com/content/54310637)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lalatoon.com/en/webtoon/episode/toon/7101), [French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_0000436), [Thai](https://th.kakaowebtoon.com/content/%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%AA%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B4%E0%B8%A2%E0%B8%A1%E0%B8%A3%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%81%E0%B8%89%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%B1%E0%B8%9A%E0%B8%99%E0%B8%B2%E0%B8%87%E0%B8%9F%E0%B9%89%E0%B8%B2/176)",
